<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>RezeのBlog</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/</link><description>这里是我的自留地。生活、兴趣、随手做的小东西，还有那些没头没尾的想法，都放在这儿。没有推荐算法，也不会突然消失。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" href="https://reze520.pages.dev/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>水调歌头·明月几时有到底有多豁达？</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-117</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-117</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>诗词</category><category>中文</category><description>这首词人人会背，所以很少有人再看它到底在说什么。它是一个三十九岁的男人，在一个喝了一夜酒的中秋写的。</description></item><item><title>一场特殊的圆度大赛：正方形竟是最圆的</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-116</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-116</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>技术</category><category>技术</category><category>数学</category><description>按不同的圆度定义算，正方形到底算不算圆。</description></item><item><title>第四面墙</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-82</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-82</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>电影</category><category>影像</category><description>舞台上的房间只有三面墙，第四面那堵不存在的墙，被所有影视作品假装存在。这篇文章按破墙能办的几件事分开讲：求你相信他、让你共谋、让你无处可躲、把墙当道具玩，最后还有一部作品把墙补了回去。</description></item><item><title>有缺陷的消费者</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-76</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-76</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>文学</category><category>社会</category><description>鲍曼说，穷人从「劳动力后备军」变成了「有缺陷的消费者」。逐章精读《工作、消费主义和新穷人》，接上英国、美国、德国、中国四个现场。</description></item><item><title>当时只道是寻常</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-115</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-115</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>日常</category><category>时间</category><category>告别</category><description>人生里有太多后知后觉。当时只当寻常，回头看才知道回不去了。</description></item><item><title>陪我讲出我们最后何以生疏</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-114</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-114</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>日常</category><category>说话</category><category>告别</category><description>话总是说不清楚的。说清楚和听进去，是两件事。</description></item><item><title>咽下去就不疼了吗</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-113</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-113</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>日常</category><category>身体</category><category>告别</category><description>咽下去的疼，从来不会真的消失。它只是安静下来。</description></item><item><title>语言是个漏斗</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-112</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-112</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>杂记</category><category>说话</category><category>语言</category><description>沟通的损耗。语言是映射，不是搬运。</description></item><item><title>仓促的骤雨</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-111</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-111</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>日常</category><category>相遇</category><category>告别</category><description>人和人之间是一场仓促的骤雨。事过境迁，留下来的还是那句话。</description></item><item><title>有缘自会再见</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-110</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-110</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>日常</category><category>相遇</category><category>告别</category><description>这句话的用处是不用追。它的代价，也在这里。</description></item><item><title>回头看的那个人</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-109</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-109</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>外国文学</category><category>爱情</category><description>那个条件从一开始就是错的。最重的是他继续往前走。</description></item><item><title>鲁智深</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-108</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-108</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>武侠</category><category>中文</category><description>鲁智深、那封书信，和一个人最后怎么修成正果。</description></item><item><title>南北犹可越</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-107</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-107</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>文史</category><category>历史</category><category>诗词</category><description>南北是空间上的隔绝，东西是时间上的隔绝。前者还能越。</description></item><item><title>大梦一场空</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-106</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-106</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>文史</category><category>历史</category><category>中文</category><description>历史、文学、哲学说的是同一件事：大梦一场空。</description></item><item><title>为什么千古文人都有侠客梦</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-105</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-105</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>侠</category><category>武侠</category><description>文人写的侠客和真实的武人是两种东西。侠客梦里是有暴力的。</description></item><item><title>为什么岛国更容易诞生推理小说</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-104</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-104</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>推理</category><category>外国文学</category><description>封闭的环境、熟人社会的反面、交通的限制。岛国推理长在日常里。</description></item><item><title>中国人为什么迷恋江湖</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-103</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-103</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>武侠</category><description>江湖让人向往，因为判断权归自己。也让人不安，因为没人管。</description></item><item><title>黄河长江，如何塑造两种截然不同的中国性格</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-102</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-102</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>历史</category><category>中文</category><description>黄河管住人，长江放走人。两条河的性格，渗到了很细的地方。</description></item><item><title>气候是如何塑造中国文学气质的</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-101</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-101</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>历史</category><category>中文</category><description>南方的写法，北方的写法。气候决定能不能出门，也决定一个地方怕什么。</description></item><item><title>「山水」是如何被发明的</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-100</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-100</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>历史</category><category>诗词</category><description>山水不是天然就在那里的风景。它是在魏晋之后才成了一个人可以面对的东西。</description></item><item><title>为什么俄国文豪众多，却很少诞生世界级推理小说</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-99</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-99</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>推理</category><category>外国文学</category><description>推理小说要因果，俄国文学要灵魂。这两件事不太容易放在一本书里。</description></item><item><title>武侠为什么只能诞生在中国</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-98</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-98</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>武侠</category><category>侠</category><description>江湖不是地理名词。武是手段，侠比它复杂得多。</description></item><item><title>为什么中国只有包青天，没有福尔摩斯</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-97</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-97</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>社会</category><category>中文</category><description>中国人期待的正义是一个人要的，不是一套程序给的。</description></item><item><title>哈利波特为什么只能诞生在英国</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-96</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-96</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>奇幻</category><category>外国文学</category><description>寄宿学校、阶层秩序、巫术残留、旧贵族童话。四块材料拼出霍格沃茨。</description></item><item><title>热带无哲学，为什么是一句傲慢的殖民语言</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-95</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-95</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>外国文学</category><category>社会</category><description>这句话借了环境决定论的外壳。它真正在说的是谁不配有思想。</description></item><item><title>为什么现代人越来越难长期专一</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-94</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-94</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>爱情</category><category>社会</category><description>确定性碎得最彻底的地方，是感情。专一最难的是耐心。</description></item><item><title>怀旧不是怀念过去，是怀念当时的自己</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-93</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-93</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>时间</category><category>社会</category><description>记忆不是录像。怀念的不是那个下午，是那个下午里的自己。</description></item><item><title>当大家都在谈上岸，幸福的定义已经变了</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-92</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-92</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>社会</category><category>内卷</category><description>先有一个岸，才有一片水。上岸把人生压缩成了一场考试。</description></item><item><title>内卷这个词，是怎么悄悄变形的</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-91</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-91</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>社会</category><category>内卷</category><description>内卷这个词，是眼看着它变质的。它被用来解释，也被用来免责。</description></item><item><title>我们为什么总喜欢追溯故乡</title><link>https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-90</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://reze520.pages.dev/post?id=post-90</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>读书</category><category>乡土</category><description>故乡其实是一套秩序。人想念的是秩序，不是地方。</description></item></channel></rss>
